  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1: Lowered the minimum target Windows version from 10.0.19041.0 to 10.0.17763.0 (Windows 10, version 1809) to relax consuming-project TargetFramework requirements; no API changes. 1.0.0: Initial release. JsonSerialController with LedControl, ServoControl, ButtonControl, and SensorControl (TMP102 temperature, ADXL345 acceleration). Two transports: SerialPortEx (USB serial) and BleNusEx (BLE Nordic UART Service), both behind ISerialDataReadWrite.",
